{
  "_about": [
    "Starter list of UK organisations for the organisation autocomplete (plan section 19), built by hand without network access.",
    "The full NHS ODS import (trusts, hospital sites, health boards) is still to do: the cloud session network policy blocks some hosts, so it may need running elsewhere.",
    "Ids are stable Wavelength ids (wl-<n>) and never change between environments. Seed ids use 1 to 99999; organisations added by administrators get 100001 upwards, so a later seed never collides with them.",
    "\"ods\" is the NHS Organisation Data Service code where it is known, kept as a hint for matching the ODS import, never as an id. Leave it out rather than guess.",
    "After editing, run node tools/organisations-seed.mjs to regenerate the seed in migrations/0013_organisations.sql (only before it is applied). Once 0013 is applied, write new rows to a new migration: node tools/organisations-seed.mjs --out migrations/<next>.sql (INSERT OR IGNORE, so existing rows are untouched)."
  ],
